ng in many media and magazines. Created as a self-promotion, this work has won many domestic and international advertising awards. It was played by over 10 million people.\nIn 2009, it was ported and released as an application for iPhone and iPodTouch by Gungho Games. Subsequently, the web was closed.", "summary": "After 17 years, they are back! A remastered version of the point-and-click game that was released on the web in 2007. Is it a game? Is it experimental interactive content? Even the creator doesn't know. Experience a strange and unique worldview that has been played over 10 million times worldwide!", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/makibishi-comic--1", "videos": [{"id": 122486, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "HVt8pHE6mYM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HVt8pHE6mYM", "title": "\u3010Indie Game\u3011MAKIBISHI COMIC Remaster:1.11", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HVt8pHE6mYM/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}